  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AF Capacity Bldg for Impact Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot; The main developmental objective of the grant proposal is to strengthen results-based monitoring and evaluation of the VAU of MRRD with focus on its capacity for primary data collection and analysis. More specifically, &quot;&quot;   To alleviate the constraints for the collection of primary data in the rural development sector where the MRRD is taking a lead, &quot;&quot;   To enhance the quality of data and analysis through technical assistance and capacity building &quot;&quot;   To upgrade of the technical and logistical capacity through capacity building and provision of equipments The central objective of this grant proposal is to strengthen the capacity of the Vulnerability Analysis Unit (VAU) of MRRD to design rigorous impact evaluations; to implement comprehensive surveys to evaluation exercises; to author independent analyses of the impact and efficiency of programs and projects focused on the rural sector; and to disseminate data and reports pertaining to rural Afghanistan.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
